{"id":"fdddab942ae105d7","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-multilinear-degree.md","title":"Unique Multilinear Representation and Degree","display":"df-multilinear-degree — Unique Multilinear Representation and Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-multilinear-degree","aliases":["28-df-multilinear-degree"],"display":"df-multilinear-degree — Unique Multilinear Representation and Degree","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 12.13 and Exercise 12.7","source_printed_pages":"267,269","source_pdf_pages":"293,295","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-multilinear-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-multilinear-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-multilinear-degree — Unique Multilinear Representation and Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 12.13 and Exercise 12.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"267,269"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"293,295"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(X_1,\\ldots,X_n)\">\\(X=(X_1,\\ldots,X_n)\\)</span> 为实多项式变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg0=0\">\\(\\deg0=0\\)</span> 在本条采用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_f(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(a)\\prod_{i:a_i=1}X_i\\prod_{i:a_i=0}(1-X_i),\\qquad\\deg(f)\\coloneqq\\deg p_f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_f(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(a)\\prod_{i:a_i=1}X_i\\prod_{i:a_i=0}(1-X_i),\\qquad\\deg(f)\\coloneqq\\deg p_f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad p_f(x)=f(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad p_f(x)=f(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\quad[(\\forall i\\in[n]\\ \\deg_{X_i}q\\le1)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ q(x)=f(x))]\\Rightarrow q=p_f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\quad[(\\forall i\\in[n]\\ \\deg_{X_i}q\\le1)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ q(x)=f(x))]\\Rightarrow q=p_f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个赋值指示乘积在其自身为1、其他布尔点为0，得到表示。唯一性对n归纳：差多项式写作A+X_nB，代X_n=0使A=0，再代1使B=0。定义约定零函数次数为0，避免常函数时优化界出现负无穷。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.13 and Exercise 12.7；印刷页 267,269；PDF 页 293,295。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第12章的 Unique Multilinear Representation and Degree，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>R7：唯一性条件中的变量次数检查显式限制为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i\">\\(X_i\\)</span> 只在给定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个不定元内有定义，避免无域全称量词调用未声明坐标。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X=(X_1,\\ldots,X_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg0=0","display":false},{"tex":"p_f(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(a)\\prod_{i:a_i=1}X_i\\prod_{i:a_i=0}(1-X_i),\\qquad\\deg(f)\\coloneqq\\deg p_f.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad p_f(x)=f(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall q\\in\\mathbb R[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\quad[(\\forall i\\in[n]\\ \\deg_{X_i}q\\le1)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ q(x)=f(x))]\\Rightarrow q=p_f.","display":true},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"X_i","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1910,"backlinks":[{"id":"8e98636e68215d36","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\deg(f)$ 见 [[28-df-multilinear-degree]]，$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-337","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-zero-error-query-complexity]]、[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]、[[28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds]]、[[28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound]]、[[28-df-multilinear-degree]]、[[28-lem-degree-query-lower-bound]]、[[28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds]]。"},{"id":"838a6fb712f8a04f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是全定义布尔函数；$d=\\deg(f)$ 见 [[28-df-multilinear-degree]]，$b=bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-block-sensitivity]]，$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}